    .. warning::
        It is recommended to use :class:`~torch.nn.parallel.DistributedDataParallel`,
        instead of this class, to do multi-GPU training, even if there is only a single
        node. See: :ref:`cuda-nn-ddp-instead` and :ref:`ddp`.

